                  "fill": "#74746F",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "If eighteen hues still prove too many to tell apart at chip size, the fallback is not fewer colours but a second level: group the directions into six families (engineering · art · design & narrative · audio & video · growth · operations), colour by family and let the icon carry the exact direction. Colour then encodes the neighbourhood, the icon encodes the address.",
