                  "content": "The reference dashboard runs a warm geometric sans at bold weight for every heading. I can't name its exact licence from a screenshot, but the category is clear — large x-height, round bowls, cut terminals, set tight and heavy. If you want that warmth, do not swap the whole system: keep Geist for everything functional and give the display face a strict job — page titles, section headings, marketing. Below, the same two lines in four candidates, body copy stays Geist in all of them.",
