                  "fill": "$text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1000,
                  "content": "A neutral chrome is not the same as a neutral product. The character should not come from tinting the buttons — it should come from something only GDHub can own. You already have three such devices; none of them are invented here, they are lifted out of the existing design and made into rules.",
