                      "content": "Eighteen tints already map to work directions. Promote them from chip decoration to the primary colour of content: the hero panel of every entity card, list group headers, avatar fallbacks, calendar events. The chrome stays grey; the work is what carries colour. No competitor's board is coloured by craft.",
