    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "M6i9b8",
      "x": 2494,
      "y": 36606,
      "name": "Cookie banner — spec",
      "width": 360,
      "height": 420,
      "content": "Cookie consent — spec\n\nSurface: card 400px, radius 16 (panel), fill neutral-0, border neutral-100, elevation e3. Bottom-left, 24px page inset; mobile 12px inset, full width.\n\nHead: IconTile 36 / radius 10 on neutral-50, lucide 'cookie' 18 in neutral-700. Title 15/600 (-0.02em), body 13/400 line-height 1.55 in neutral-500.\n\nActions: two equal buttons, height 40, radius 8 (control). 'Essential only' = outline neutral-200; 'Accept all' = graphite neutral-900 / white label. Equal weight — no dark pattern.\n\nFooter: 'Manage' 13/500 neutral-500 with sliders icon; 'Cookie policy' 13/500 brand-700 (link role).\n\nPreferences: same card, categories on a neutral-25 panel (radius 12). Essential row is a disabled toggle + 'Required' chip; Analytics = Google Tag Manager. Actions become 'Save selection' (outline) + 'Accept all'.\n\nInverse (landing / dark bands): surface neutral-900, border #FFFFFF1F, action = brand-500 with ink label (white on brand-500 is 3.4:1), link = brand-400.\n\nBrand orange never fills a button in the product theme — only on inverse surfaces."
    },
